  (28, NULL, 'Trumpet', 'trumpet', 'Live 1:1 and group Trumpet classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>This program develops breath control, discipline, coordination, listening skills, and musical expression, while building confidence through performance.</p>', 1500.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Trumpet.jpg', 0, 1, 0),
  (29, NULL, 'Sitar', 'sitar', 'Live 1:1 and group Sitar classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>Indian Classical Sitar Program (Hindustani Tradition)</p><p>Level 1 → Foundation (6–8 months)Level 2 → Raga Development &amp; Technique (6–8 months)Level 3 → Advanced Performance &amp; Mastery (8–12 months)</p><p>• Live online classes (1:1 or group)• Weekly structured sessions• Guided riyaz (practice routines)• Assignment-based progression• Periodic performance reviews• Feedback-driven learning• Optional certification pathway</p><p>This program develops concentration, finger dexterity, disciplined practice, tonal awareness, and cultural appreciation, while enhancing creativity and confidence through structured melodic training and performance.</p><p>(Keep same as your file — no change needed)</p><p>The Sitar is one of the most iconic string instruments in Hindustani classical music, renowned globally for its rich, resonant tone and versatility. The Sitar consists of:</p><p>🎓 Hindustani Classical Tradition (Guru–Shishya Parampara)</p><p>This is the traditional way of learning Indian classical music, where the student learns directly from a Guru (master) through:</p>', 600.0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0),
  (30, NULL, 'Recorder', 'recorder', 'Live 1:1 and group Recorder classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '', 600.0, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0);
INSERT INTO `courses` (`id`, `sku`, `name`, `slug`, `short_description`, `description`, `regular_price`, `sale_price`, `image_url`, `is_featured`, `is_published`, `position`) VALUES
  (31, NULL, 'Carnatic Violin', 'carnatic-violin', 'Live 1:1 and group Carnatic Violin classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '', 1000.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Carnatic-3.jpg', 0, 1, 0),
  (32, NULL, 'Carnatic Vocal Music', 'carnatic-vocal-music', 'Live 1:1 and group Carnatic Vocal Music classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>Carnatic vocal music is a classical tradition originating from South India, characterized by its emphasis on intricate melodies, rhythmic precision, and devotional themes. In this art form, vocalists play a central role, rendering compositions that follow specific ragas and talas. The music often carries spiritual depth and cultural significance, making Carnatic vocal music a revered classical genre.</p><p>Start learning Carnatic Vocal Music from the comfort of your home!</p><p>Why Choose Online Carnatic Vocal Music Classes?</p><p>Rich Cultural Heritage: Carnatic vocal music is deeply embedded in the cultural fabric of South India, carrying centuries-old traditions and spiritual depth. Choosing this genre allows you to connect with a profound cultural heritage.</p><p>Melodic Complexity: The intricate melodic patterns of Carnatic music, expressed through a vast array of ragas, provide a unique and challenging musical journey. Learning to navigate these melodies enhances your understanding of musical intricacies.</p><p>Spiritual and Devotional Essence: Many Carnatic compositions carry devotional and spiritual themes, offering a transcendent and emotional musical experience. Engaging with these compositions allows you to explore the spiritual dimensions of music.</p><p>Rhythmic Precision: Carnatic music places a strong emphasis on rhythmic precision through talas. Mastering the rhythmic intricacies contributes to a well-rounded musical education, fostering a sense of discipline and control.</p><p>Vocal Expression: Carnatic vocal music places the human voice at the forefront, allowing for nuanced expression and emotional depth. Choosing to specialize in vocal music enables you to convey intricate musical nuances with your voice.</p>', 600.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Carnatic-4.jpg', 0, 1, 0),
  (33, NULL, 'Hindustani Vocal Music', 'hindustani-vocal-music', 'Live 1:1 and group Hindustani Vocal Music classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>Hindustani vocal music, a classical tradition originating in the Indian subcontinent, is characterized by its emphasis on improvisation, intricate melodic patterns, and the use of ragas and talas. The genre&#x27;s rich history involves contributions from various musicians and scholars, with a profound connection between performers and audiences. In Hindustani vocal music, artists express deep emotions and narratives through their voices, employing techniques such as ornamentation and vibrato. The diverse repertoire spans devotional, classical, semi-classical, and experimental compositions. Gharanas, distinct musical schools, have played a significant role in shaping the tradition.</p><p>Start learning Hindustani Vocal Music from the comfort of your home!</p><p>Why Choose Online Hindustani Vocal Music Classes?</p><p>Expert Instructors: We have a team of experienced and talented vocal instructors who are master’s degree holders in Hindustani music or equivalent and are dedicated to helping you develop your vocal skills and achieve your musical goals. They possess a deep understanding of Hindustani vocal music and are passionate about sharing their knowledge with students.</p><p>Cultural Connection: Hindustani vocal music is deeply rooted in Indian culture and heritage, offering learners a profound connection to centuries-old traditions and artistic expressions.</p><p>Artistic Expression: Hindustani vocal music provides a platform for creative self-expression through melody, rhythm, and emotion, allowing learners to explore their artistic potential and develop their unique voice.</p><p>Musical Proficiency: Hindustani vocal training equips learners with essential musical skills such as pitch control, breath control, voice modulation, and improvisation, enhancing overall vocal proficiency and musicianship.</p><p>Emotional Intelligence: Engaging with Hindustani music fosters emotional intelligence as learners delve into the evocative expressions of different ragas and compositions, deepening their understanding of human emotions and cultural nuances.</p>', 600.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Hindustani-Vocal.jpg.jpeg', 0, 1, 0),
  (34, NULL, 'Western Vocal Music', 'western-vocal-music', 'Live 1:1 and group Western Vocal Music classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>Why Choose Online Western Vocal Music Classes?</p><p>Expert Instructors: We have a team of experienced and talented vocal instructors who are certified from Trinity College London/Associated Board of the Royal Schools of Music/Rockschool or equivalent, who are dedicated to helping you develop your vocal skills and achieve your musical goals. They possess a deep understanding of Western vocal techniques and are passionate about sharing their knowledge with students.</p><p>Flexible Learning: With our online classes, you can enjoy the convenience of learning from the comfort of your own home, at your own pace. We offer flexible scheduling options to accommodate your busy lifestyle, allowing you to pursue your passion for music without disrupting your daily routine.</p><p>Comprehensive Curriculum: Our curriculum is carefully crafted to provide a well-rounded education in Western vocal music. Through our coaching students can apply for certifications from Trinity College London/Associated Board of the Royal Schools of Music/Rockschool. From vocal warm-ups and breathing exercises to exploring various musical genres and styles, our classes cover a wide range of topics to enhance your vocal abilities and musical understanding.</p><p>Personalized Approach: We understand that every student is unique, with different learning styles and goals. That&#x27;s why our instructors tailor their teaching methods to meet your individual needs and coach you for the certification of your choice. Whether you&#x27;re interested in pop, rock, jazz, or classical music, we&#x27;ll help you develop a versatile voice that can adapt to any genre.</p><p>Affordable Pricing: We believe that high-quality music education should be accessible to everyone. That&#x27;s why we offer competitive pricing options that fit various budgets. We are committed to providing exceptional value for your investment in your musical journey.</p><p>Enhanced Academic Performance: Studies have shown a positive correlation between music education and academic performance. Learning to sing involves various cognitive skills such as memory, attention, and pattern recognition, which can contribute to improved academic abilities.</p><p>Improved Discipline and Time Management: Committing to regular online classes fosters discipline and time management skills. These qualities are transferable to academic pursuits, helping children develop effective study habits and meet deadlines.</p>', 600.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Western-Music-.jpg.jpeg', 0, 1, 0),
