  (55, NULL, 'Arts & Painting', 'arts-painting', 'Live 1:1 and group Arts & Painting classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>Why Choose Online Arts and Painting Classes?</p><p>In a world where screens dominate our daily lives, it&#x27;s no surprise that the realm of education has also shifted its focus to the digital sphere. Online learning platforms have revolutionized how we acquire new skills, and the realm of arts and painting is no exception. Whether you&#x27;re a seasoned artist or an eager beginner, the benefits of enrolling in online arts and painting classes are boundless. Here&#x27;s why you should consider embracing the virtual canvas:</p>', 200.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Arts-And-Painting-1.jpg', 0, 1, 0),
  (56, NULL, 'Creative Writing', 'creative-writing', 'Live 1:1 and group Creative Writing classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '', 300.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/content-writing-course1s.jpg', 0, 1, 0),
  (57, NULL, 'Public Speaking', 'public-speaking', 'Live 1:1 and group Public Speaking classes with expert mentors. Flexible scheduling, first demo free.', '<p>Online Public Speaking – Trial Class Plan (Session 1)</p><p>Duration: 60–75 MinutesMode: Online (Teacher + 5 Students)Theme: Introduction to Public Speaking &amp; SWOT-Based Speaking Activity</p><p>Objective: Make students comfortable and start speaking immediately.</p><p>“When you hear the words Public Speaking, what comes to your mind?”</p><p>2. What Exactly is Public Speaking? (8–10 minutes)</p><p>Public Speaking is the ability to speak clearly, confidently, and effectively in front of an audience with the purpose of:</p><p>It is not only about talking. It is about:✅ Confidence✅ Clear thoughts✅ Strong body language✅ Knowing your audience✅ Structuring your ideas✅ Using voice effectively</p><p>Public speaking is a life skill. It helps in:</p>', 150.0, NULL, 'https://indiatutorsonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Public-Speaking.jpg', 0, 1, 0),
